## 📊 Secrets Management Comparison

| Approach | Pros | Cons | Best For |
|----------|------|------|----------|
| **dotenv** | Simple, fast, no dependencies | Secrets in files, not production-ready | Local development |
| **AWS Secrets Manager** | Encrypted, auto-rotation, audit logs | Cost, AWS dependency | Production AWS infra |
| **HashiCorp Vault** | Feature-rich, multi-cloud | Complex setup | Enterprise |
| **Environment Variables** | Built-in, no file I/O | Visible in process list, limited size | Container deployments |
| **Kubernetes Secrets** | Native to K8s | Encoded, not encrypted by default | K8s environments |

